  "body": "What is missing: no test proves that a fixture or clamp in the newly cleared stock margin is flagged. A whole-model 3D Pocket now clears the margin out to the stock outline. This changes posted motion.\n\nEvidence: the PR #1780 body lists this as \"not exercised\". The reviewer noted that no test puts a clamp in the margin. See `crates/app/tests/pocket3d_open_side.rs`. A collision check is under the safety floor.\n\nFound in the review of PR #1780. Related: #1774.\n\nDone means: a test adds a fixture or clamp in the cleared margin. The test asserts that verify reports it and that the post is blocked or refused. A mutation check shows that the test fails if the fixture check is off.\n",
